# What stays out of the .vsix (FR-OPS-8). The package ships the compiled
# `out/` tree, the manifest, the media, and the three listing documents —
# nothing else. Sources and tests are on GitHub; shipping them only makes the
# download bigger and the listing noisier.
.vscode/**
.vscode-test/**
src/**
test/**
out-tests/**
out/**/*.map
out/**/*.tsbuildinfo
node_modules/**
**/tsconfig*.json
**/eslint.config.mjs
**/.eslintrc*
**/.prettierrc*
**/*.ts
!out/**/*.js
docs/**
examples/**
**/.study-data/**
PROJECT_GUIDE.md
media/icon.svg
